# ***Area and Identity Based Scoring***

Cities working with Tolemi use the Score Manager to build composite scores for properties, census block groups, and even custom geographies. Combine any data in BuildingBlocks, assign each factor the right weight and impact, and you can quickly see how neighborhoods, owners, or properties compare to one another.

### ***Ways to Use Scoring***

Scores can help you:

- Identify areas with low resident engagement
- Pinpoint neighborhoods for redevelopment
- Prioritize inspections
- Assess fire risk

### ***Score Owners, Not Just Places***

Scoring doesn't have to be based on geography. You can also score owners and other property identities, which can increase transparency and compliance.

### ***Common Criteria***

Area-based scores often draw on:

- Code violations
- Calls for service
- Demographic data
- Residential density

How could scoring improve efficiency and service delivery in your city? [Reach out to learn more about Tolemi scores](mailto:support@tolemi.com).
